		(property "Note" "Sensor VCC switch (BH1750+SHT40+their I2C pull-ups): S=VOUT_3V3 D=SENSOR_3V3 G=P1_13_SENSOR_EN. Added when nRF54 moved onto VOUT_3V3 (was VDD_NRF direct-battery) - sensors need their own switch now to still power down in deep sleep. R1/R2 (I2C pull-ups) moved to SENSOR_3V3 too, so an unpowered sensor isn't backfed through its own SDA/SCL ESD clamps."
			(at 0 0 270)
			(unlocked yes)
			(layer "F.Fab")
