		(descr "Inductor SMD 1008 (2520 Metric), square (rectangular) end terminal, IPC-7351 nominal, (Body size source: https://ecsxtal.com/store/pdf/ECS-MPI2520-SMD-POWER-INDUCTOR.pdf)")
